# Migration Safety

Hard rules and the retired/deferred lists live in `AGENTS.md`. Apply them before proposing changes.

Cursor reminder: the manager is Electron (`Asher.Electron`) + `Asher.Host`; the WPF manager is
retired. Inspect the source before suggesting work; completed work is not a to-do list. Do not
recreate retired functionality, duplicate existing logic, or change JSONL shapes / file layouts /
the launcher chain without a concrete requirement.
